'''Ming Po Town''',<ref name="BMF">{{BuildFalconCite|79|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> also known as '''Ming Po village'''<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> was a small [[City|town]] that was the home of the [[Ming Po]] on the [[planet]] [[Carlac]]. A number of buildings in the town were burned and destroyed by [[Death Watch]] forces commanded by [[Pre Vizsla]].<ref name="A Friend in Need" />

